    { count: 6, label: '"555 and Beyond" Logic', scale: 'overload', verbatim: `In the psychomatrix, the presence of three fives significantly attenuates one's logical faculties, rendering the manifestation of logic more of a sporadic occurrence—a surprise—than a consistent, predictable pattern. In this instance, these numbers are almost entirely overshadowed by the Line of Family Provision (for men) or the Line of Family (for women). At certain moments, the quality of "clear-knowing" may manifest; however, because the scope of their vision is so vast, the individual often struggles to believe in their own insights—a skepticism that renders their predictions seemingly implausible.` }
